qore-ssh-module (1.0.0~git20260928.1-0qore1~ubuntu26.04) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Package native SSH server/key bindings, four source/compiled user modules,
    metadata, resources/translations, docs, examples and debug symbols.
  * Add installed runtime/compiler qualification and real OpenSSH client tests.
  * Resolve test/example modules by name to support installed packages.
  * Give the executable command-server example its missing interpreter line.
  * Give loopback sandbox fixtures explicit permission to bind.
  * Preserve AOT metadata and support profiles/reproducible offline builds.

